    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="388">06:28</a> 我的健身减脂心路历程</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>初高中：一放假就胖，一上学就瘦回来</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>大学：微胖，从keep开始健身</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>工作：办公室工作，胡吃海喝，但是高强度跳舞</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>环球旅行：不稳定的作息、饮食和运动习惯</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>澳洲打工度假：体力劳动，不胖不瘦</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>最近一年：天天坐办公室，无运动，明显体脂变高</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">21:40</a> 曾经宽松的裤子穿不进去了，让我很震惊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1706">28:26</a> 下定决心，去健身房办卡！</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>开始比完美更重要：降低心理门槛</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>先从几个简单重复动作开始：降低决策门槛</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2125">35:25</a> 饮食</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>健身三个多月，体脂变化并不明显</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>决定开始记录饮食（app: Cronometer )</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>第一次直观的感受到食物提供能量和营养的差别</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>控制饮食的好处：省时省力省钱，还减脂！</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2715">45:15</a> 为了健康考虑：控制血糖、预防糖尿病</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>播客推荐：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6481a7e16752b5f9de42b35e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6481a7e16752b5f9de42b35e"><span>纵横四海 - 《更壮更瘦更强》：如何减肥能更健康、有效、不反弹！</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6408248c6a0de4e928e5fae0" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6408248c6a0de4e928e5fae0"><span>末日狂花 - 和瘦了 50 斤的西蓝发聊聊你对“减F”好奇的一切</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6944f0791d7e78adb4a8915e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6944f0791d7e78adb4a8915e"><span>生物解码 - 如何科学吃碳水？先吃肉还是先吃饭？营养学博士的控糖实验室</span></a><